      "start_time_s": 1.14,
      "end_time_s": 6.52,
      "duration_s": 5.38,
      "text": "Bonjour à tous, merci d'être venus. Nous devons valider le planning du sprint 4 avant midi.",
      "speaker_position": [
        4.42,
        3.64,
        1.78
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.17
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_2",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 2",
      "gender": "male",
      "language": "fr",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 6.84,
      "end_time_s": 15.86,
      "duration_s": 9.02,
      "text": "Salut. J'ai regardé les tickets. L'architecture du nouveau module semble un peu complexe pour le délai imparti.",
      "speaker_position": [
        2.96,
        8.29,
        1.23
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.0
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_3",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 3",
      "gender": "female",
      "language": "fr",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 16.37,
      "end_time_s": 23.37,
      "duration_s": 7.0,
      "text": "C'est vrai, mais c'est nécessaire pour réduire la dette technique. Si on ne le fait pas maintenant, ça va nous faire mal plus tard.",
      "speaker_position": [
        5.68,
        6.94,
        1.78
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.33
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_4",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 4",
      "gender": "male",
      "language": "fr",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 23.83,
      "end_time_s": 39.93,
      "duration_s": 16.1,
      "text": "Je suis d'accord avec Sarah. Par contre, le budget alloué pour les licences tierces a un peu diminué cette semaine.",
      "speaker_position": [
        6.4,
        4.14,
        1.25
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.0
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_5",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 5",
      "gender": "female",
      "language": "fr",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 40.21,
      "end_time_s": 44.35,
      "duration_s": 4.14,
      "text": "Ah bon ? Combien exactement ? Cela va-t-il impacter nos serveurs de test ?",
      "speaker_position": [
        7.14,
        5.21,
        1.71
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.0
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_6",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 6",
      "gender": "male",
      "language": "fr",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 44.71,
      "end_time_s": 51.8,
      "duration_s": 7.09,
      "text": "Environ 15%. Mais c'est encore diminiashable si on optimise l'utilisation des ressources cloud.",
      "speaker_position": [
        2.79,
        1.3,
        1.12
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.4
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_1",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 1",
      "gender": "female",
      "language": "fr",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 52.05,
      "end_time_s": 56.08,
      "duration_s": 4.03,
      "text": "Diminiashable... Intéressant. Donc, on peut maintenir la qualité sans surcoût ?",
      "speaker_position": [
        4.42,
        3.64,
        1.78
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.17
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_4",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 4",
      "gender": "male",
      "language": "fr",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 56.43,
      "end_time_s": 64.0,
      "duration_s": 7.57,
      "text": "Oui, à condition qu'on arrête de payer pour ces consultations inutiles du cabinet consultary externe.",
      "speaker_position": [
        6.4,
        4.14,
        1.25
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.0
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_3",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 3",
      "gender": "female",
      "language": "fr",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 64.39,
      "end_time_s": 69.18,
      "duration_s": 4.79,
      "text": "Tu parles de l'équipe de conseil ? Ils ont pourtant validé notre choix technologique.",
      "speaker_position": [
        5.68,
        6.94,
        1.78
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.33
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_2",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 2",
      "gender": "male",
      "language": "fr",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 69.66,
      "end_time_s": 76.2,
      "duration_s": 6.54,
      "text": "Leurs recommandations sont bonnes, mais leur rapport final avait une belle badigeon de jargon pour justifier le prix.",
      "speaker_position": [
        2.96,
        8.29,
        1.23
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.0
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_5",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 5",
      "gender": "female",
      "language": "fr",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 76.59,
      "end_time_s": 80.84,
      "duration_s": 4.25,
      "text": "Tu as raison. Ils ont rendu le processus compliqué pour paraître indispensables.",
