      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.33
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_1",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 1",
      "gender": "female",
      "language": "fr",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 115.63,
      "end_time_s": 118.21,
      "duration_s": 2.58,
      "text": "Oui, à 9h. Merci à tous.",
      "speaker_position": [
        4.42,
        3.64,
        1.78
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.17
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_4",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 4",
      "gender": "male",
      "language": "fr",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 118.54,
      "end_time_s": 128.19,
      "duration_s": 9.65,
      "text": "J'ai vérifié les métriques de performance, elles sont dans la marge d'erreur acceptable.",
      "speaker_position": [
        6.4,
        4.14,
        1.25
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.0
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_5",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 5",
      "gender": "female",
      "language": "fr",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 128.37,
      "end_time_s": 133.58,
      "duration_s": 5.21,
      "text": "C'est un soulagement, car le client a peur que notre solution ne soit qu'un badigeon sur l'ancien système.",
      "speaker_position": [
        7.14,
        5.21,
        1.71
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.0
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_1",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 1",
      "gender": "female",
      "language": "fr",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 134.03,
      "end_time_s": 139.41,
      "duration_s": 5.38,
      "text": "Justement, c'est pour ça qu'on a choisi une architecture micro-services, pas juste une couche superficielle.",
      "speaker_position": [
        4.42,
        3.64,
        1.78
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.17
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_2",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 2",
      "gender": "male",
      "language": "fr",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 139.95,
      "end_time_s": 145.47,
      "duration_s": 5.52,
      "text": "Mais il faut qu'on s'assure que chaque module reste diminishable en cas de besoin budgétaire.",
      "speaker_position": [
        2.96,
        8.29,
        1.23
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.0
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_6",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 6",
      "gender": "male",
      "language": "fr",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 145.99,
      "end_time_s": 149.86,
      "duration_s": 3.87,
      "text": "Tu veux dire qu'on peut retirer des fonctionnalités secondaires sans casser le tout ?",
      "speaker_position": [
        2.79,
        1.3,
        1.12
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.4
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_3",
      "speaker_name": "Speaker 3",
      "gender": "female",
      "language": "fr",
      "vocal_style": "normal",
      "start_time_s": 150.04,
      "end_time_s": 155.74,
      "duration_s": 5.7,
      "text": "Exactement, c'est le principe de la modularité. Si le budget s'ajuste, on adapte.",
      "speaker_position": [
        5.68,
        6.94,
        1.78
      ],
      "speaker_size": 0.33
    },
    {
      "speaker_id": "speaker_4",
